# K02c with K01: the caller's merge result has `value` at ANOTHER position (Wide: pad first) than the unit-level
# result read was checked against; the field is selected by its NAME on the actual candidate (Codex, DS-CODEX-004,
# point 4), through the admission's pair map -- 22, never pad's 5.  Success is 7.
Model: (int: value 1)
Wide: (int: pad 5; int: value 22)
copy: merge: Model
fn: read () int
return: copy\value
fn: caller () int
    copy: merge: Wide
    return: read()
end: caller
int: result caller()
if: result != 22
    sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 81; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
    return
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
